### Component 3 — Vite Dev Proxy

#### [MODIFY] [vite.config.js](file:///d:/Fyp_Project/frontend/visionsnare/vite.config.js)

Add a dev proxy to forward `/api` requests to the FastAPI backend at `http://localhost:8000`:

```js
server: {
  proxy: {
    '/api': 'http://localhost:8000'
  }
}
```

