Fix discrepancies between UI text and actual model behavior.

#### [MODIFY] [HowItWorks.jsx](file:///d:/Fyp_Project/frontend/visionsnare/src/pages/HowItWorks.jsx)

- Step 3 tech pills: `'NPR 2×2', 'NPR 3×3', 'NPR 4×4'` → `'NPR 2×2'`
- Step 3 model text: remove "3×3, and 4×4" multi-scale references
- Step 4: `'16-frame Sequences'` → `'12-frame Sequences'`
