#### [MODIFY] [About.jsx](file:///d:/Fyp_Project/frontend/visionsnare/src/pages/About.jsx)

- Pipeline array: `'16-frame temporal aggregation'` → `'11-frame temporal aggregation'`
- Approach section: "2×2, 3×3, and 4×4" → "2×2"
- Architecture cards: NPR description fix, "16-frame sequence" → "11-frame sequence" (since temporal differencing reduces 12→11)
- Spatial NPR pipeline step: `'2×2, 3×3, 4×4 pixel-diff grids'` → `'2×2 pixel-diff grids'`

#### [MODIFY] [Detect.jsx](file:///d:/Fyp_Project/frontend/visionsnare/src/pages/Detect.jsx)

- Result card NPR Grids meta: `'2×2, 3×3, 4×4'` → `'2×2'`

